#: index.md:5
#, no-c-format
msgid "InstUI, everywhere"
msgstr "InstUI，无处不在"

#: index.md:6
#, no-c-format
msgid "One resolved token model, reshaped into stylesheets, framework bindings, native code, and design-tool payloads."
msgstr "一个解析后的令牌模型，重塑为样式表、框架绑定、本地代码和设计工具的载荷。"

#: index.md:9
#, no-c-format
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "快速入门"

#: index.md:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "The package map"
msgstr "包映射"

#: index.md:15
#, no-c-format
msgid "API reference"
msgstr "API 参考"

#: index.md:18
#, no-c-format
msgid "CSS reference"
msgstr "CSS 参考"

#: index.md:24
#, no-c-format
msgid "One source of truth"
msgstr "单一事实来源"

#: index.md:25
#, no-c-format
msgid "Every package reads the same resolved token IR. Change a token upstream and it flows to CSS, SCSS, native code, and Figma the same way."
msgstr "每个包都读取相同的已解析令牌 IR。在上游更改令牌后，它会以相同方式流向 CSS、SCSS、本地代码和 Figma。"

#: index.md:29
#, no-c-format
msgid "Use the smallest package"
msgstr "使用最小化包"

#: index.md:30
#, no-c-format
msgid "Install just @pantoken/css for a stylesheet, @pantoken/react for hooks and icons, or a bundler preset for Tailwind, Panda, or MUI."
msgstr "仅安装 @pantoken/css 获取样式表，安装 @pantoken/react 获取 hooks 和图标，或安装针对 Tailwind、Panda 或 MUI 的打包器预设。"

#: index.md:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "Generate for any platform"
msgstr "为任意平台生成"

#: index.md:35
#, no-c-format
msgid "Run `pantoken generate` to emit Swift, Kotlin, Compose, Flutter, Rust, WordPress, and more. The same tokens, in each ecosystem's idiom."
msgstr "运行 `pantoken generate` 来生成 Swift、Kotlin、Compose、Flutter、Rust、WordPress 等。相同的令牌，以每个生态系统的习惯用法呈现。"

#: index.md:39
#, no-c-format
msgid "No upstream coupling"
msgstr "无上游耦合"

#: index.md:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The tokens ship vendored as static JSON, so `npm i` never reaches for a GitHub-only source. Publishable, semver'd, offline-friendly."
msgstr "这些令牌作为静态 JSON 随包发布，因此 `npm i` 永远不会依赖仅限 GitHub 的源。可发布、遵循语义化版本控制、离线友好。"
